            <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTTP/3" target="_blank" rel="external noopener"
               title="HTTP/3 - Wikipedia">
                <q>HTTP/3 - Wikipedia</q>
            </a>
        </cite>
    </p>
</article>
